    "Defense Attributes": "Fire 20, Water 20, Wind 53, Earth 20, Holy 20, Unholy 20",
    "Skills": "Raid Boss Lv. 1 Raid Boss reward chance is reduced based on the level difference. Boss is higher: +5 - 85%, +6 - 70%, +7 - 50%, +8 - 35%. Player is higher: +6 - 85%, +7 - 70%, +8 - 50%. If player is 9 or more levels higher, Raid Curse is applied. Raid Boss Lv. 1 This Orc Warrior invaded the Cemetery as part of High Prefect Arak's plan to capture Aden Castle. Frustrated by the constant fighting with the monsters of the Cemetery, he and his men began to run short on supplies. His successful solution earned him the nickname Grave Robber Kim. Humanoids Lv. 6 Takes 15% increased damage from attacks that are effective against Humanoids. Atk. Spd. +2.5% Accuracy +3 Evasion +2 P. Def. -5% Received Critical Damage +5% Resistance to Bleed -10% Resist Full Magic Attack Lv. 1",
